    <ahoj:claimSubject rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/Interface_binding_pocket"/>
    <ahoj:claimText>The paper states that interface pockets are often neglected or misrepresented because of their complexity. AHoJ-DB explicitly supports such pockets.</ahoj:claimText>
  </rdf:Description>
