    <ahoj:claimSubject rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/PDB"/>
    <ahoj:claimText>The paper observes consistently higher numbers of pockets, structures, and chains for holo states than apo states. This is interpreted as evidence of an inherent PDB bias toward holo structures.</ahoj:claimText>
