  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ahoj/claim/C065">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/ontology/ClaimTriplet"/>
    <rdfs:label>C065: AHoJ_DB - is claimed to be - Comprehensive_apo_holo_database_claim</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/Article_AHoJDB_2024"/>
    <ahoj:claimObject rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/Comprehensive_apo_holo_database_claim"/>
    <ahoj:claimPredicate rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/predicate/is_claimed_to_be"/>
    <ahoj:claimSubject rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/AHoJ_DB"/>
    <ahoj:claimText>In the conclusion, the authors state that AHoJ-DB is, to their knowledge, the most comprehensive database for apo and holo structures to date. This claim is based on the scale and pocket-centric coverage reported in the paper.</ahoj:claimText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ahoj/predicate/uses_distance_cutoff">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
    <rdfs:label>uses distance cutoff</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ahoj/claim/C056">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/ontology/ClaimTriplet"/>
    <rdfs:label>C056: Ligand - may stabilize - Less_ordered_pocket</rdfs:label>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/Article_AHoJDB_2024"/>
    <ahoj:claimObject rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/Less_ordered_pocket"/>
    <ahoj:claimPredicate rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/predicate/may_stabilize"/>
    <ahoj:claimSubject rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ahoj/entity/Ligand"/>
    <ahoj:claimText>The paper suggests that some ligands may bind less ordered pockets or structures that are harder to resolve in the absence of ligand. This is offered as a possible explanation for ligand-specific differences in apo coverage.</ahoj:claimText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ahoj/predicate/has_apo_result_for">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"/>
    <rdfs:label>has apo result for</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
